      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Given coins and amount, return minimum number of coins needed."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Approach: Bottom-Up DP"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "title": "O(amount \u00b7 n) O(amount)",
        "language": "csharp",
        "code": "public int CoinChange(int[] coins, int amount)\n{\n    int[] dp = new int[amount + 1];\n    Array.Fill(dp, amount + 1);\n    dp[0] = 0;\n    Array.Sort(coins);\n    for (int i = 1; i <= amount; i++)\n    {\n        foreach (int coin in coins)\n        {\n            if (coin > i) break;\n            dp[i] = Math.Min(dp[i], dp[i - coin] + 1);\n        }\n    }\n    return dp[amount] > amount ? -1 : dp[amount];\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "comparison-cards",
      "data": {
        "title": "Approach Comparison",
        "cards": [
